so I tried:
gs=gstat(id="x", formula=zinc~(x+y)^4, data=meuse)
pgs=predict(gs, newdata, meuse.grid)

and it worked!

so it is possible to calculate trend over 3th polynominal (now its not a 
metter for what :))) in that way?

regards
Jarek




